  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I juli 2018 best&#xe4;llde ambassaden en s&#xe4;rskild granskningsrevision av projektet Regional Envrionment Center i BIH, ELAN-Environmental Lobbying och Advocacy CSO Network. Orsaken beror p&#xe5; problem i samband med styrningen av REC Regional Office och REC Country office.
Slutrapporten ska vara f&#xe4;rdig i slutet av augusti</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In July 2018 the Embassy commissioned a special audit review of the Regional Envrionment Center project in BIH, ELAN-Environmental Lobbying and Advocacy CSO Network.  The reason is due to problems related to the governance of REC Regional Office and REC Country office.  
Final reporting to be completed by end August.</narrative>
